     "text": "## Board's back\n\n**Not bricked.** The plain update file went over the bootloader through the USB installer. To recover:\n\n1. Hold **BOOT**, plug it in, let go.\n2. Pick the file ending in `-full.bin`.\n3. Tick *Erase*, then **Install**.\n\n| File | Use it for |\n| --- | --- |\n| `-full.bin` | The cable, first install |\n| `.bin` | Updates over Wi-Fi |\n\n> The installer now refuses plain update files.\n\n```\npython -m esptool --chip esp32p4 write-flash 0x0 deskling-full.bin\n```\n\n- Checked on the sim\n  - and on the board\n- See [the setup guide](https://deskling.mojolayers.com/setup) for more",
